<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11991"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Weeza<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Weeza<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 22, 2005 - 3:14 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->A follow up, very sad <BR><a href="http://www.sfgate.com/cgi-bin/article.cgi?file=/news/archive/2000/04/01/state1510EST0130.DTL" target=_top>http://www.sfgate.com/cgi-bin/article.cgi?file=/ne ws/archive/2000/04/01/state1510EST0130.DTL</a> <BR> <BR>a more recent follow up <BR><a href="http://www.sfgate.com/cgi-bin/article.cgi?f=/c/a/2002/06/06/MN95165.DTL" target=_top>http://www.sfgate.com/cgi-bin/article.cgi?f=/c/a/2 002/06/06/MN95165.DTL</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
