<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11992"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:bbyrum9@foothill.net" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Nightdriver<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Nightdriver<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 22, 2005 - 3:27 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->If you read the jailhouse interviews with Anderson, you will come away knowing less than before you started. It&#39;s kinda obvious that he something to do with it. And yes, her skull was found off SR 17, near the Santa Clara-Santa Cruz county line. That&#39;s about 70 road miles South of Vallejo, not 500. It would be appreciated if you folks would find some other cases to talk about. I thought I was going to be able to forget that Mr. Anderson ever existed. The more I have seen on him, the less I consider him part of the human race.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11992-->
<!--Post: 12128--><!--Time: 1111615153-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12128"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 23, 2005 - 1:59 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->can someone get me a map of where bugay is buried and a photo of the grave, I need a map of Antioch a city map, the ones I can get are not good enough, Thanks E.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12128-->
<!--Post: 12131--><!--Time: 1111624639-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12131"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 23, 2005 - 4:37 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->night I am very sorry, that we have brought up a bad subject such as this to discuss. Please bare with us we are trying to find answers that may help. I have started a website, dedicated to the missing children that are dear to every one here. Please do not be offended, we are all just trying to help in any way we can. When I was a child, I was taken, I was lucky enough to be released. God has allowed me to live for a reason, so I am trying to do everything I can to help as I know the others here are as well. I have recently discovered that someone has stolen my identity form ten years ago. The sick people in this world need to be stoped. This is the only way I know how to do that, is by searching for answers. Thanks E.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12131-->
<!--Post: 12152--><!--Time: 1111672558-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12152"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Ivy_leaguer<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Ivy_leaguer<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 24, 2005 - 5:55 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Larry Christopher Graham, a former boyfriend of Susan Bugay was found guilty of her daughter&#39;s murder in August 2002. Graham abducted Angela Bugay on November 19 1983 while she accompanied her younger brother to retrieve his boots from their apartment in Antioch. Angela Bugay&#39;s corpse was discovered a week later in a shallow grave in a secluded field a short distance from the apartment. Graham was arrested in 1996 after forensic scientists matched his DNA to the seminal fluid obtained from the corpse. In October 2002, Graham was sentenced to death. <BR> <BR>John Philpin&#39;s book contains a photograph of Angela Bugay&#39;s grave at the Oakmont cemetery.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12152-->
<!--Post: 12238--><!--Time: 1111791387-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12238"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 25, 2005 - 2:56 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Thank you Ivy_leaguer for the info, here is view of cemetary, the reason i ask is because their are a few in this cemetary from this thread I want to know &#40;withot being sued&#41; for asking this question why a sex offender would visit the different grave of these vics. I want to know which girls are buried in this cem. and how close or far away there graves are from the other, <BR> <BR><a href="http://terraserver.microsoft.com/addressimage.aspx?t=4&amp;s=11&amp;lon=-122.10194075799&amp;lat=37.9476506009252&amp;alon=-122.09853798&amp;alat=37.9476431&amp;w=1&amp;opt=0&amp;qs=2099%2BReliez%2BValley%2BRoad%2B%7clafayette%7c&amp;addr=2099%2BReliez%2BValley%2BRd%2c%2BLafayette%2c%2BCA%2B94549" target=_top>http://terraserver.microsoft.com/addressimage.aspx ?t=4&amp;s=11&amp;lon=-122.10194075799&amp;lat=37.947650600925 2&amp;alon=-122.09853798&amp;alat=37.9476431&amp;w=1&amp;opt=0&amp;qs= 2099&#43;Reliez&#43;Valley&#43;Road&#43;%7clafayette%7c&amp;addr=2099&#43; Reliez&#43;Valley&#43;Rd%2c&#43;Lafayette%2c&#43;CA&#43;94549</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
