<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12337"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tallulabay<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tallulabay<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->3-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, March 28, 2005 - 1:45 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Within a circle there is a fire. This fire spreads.  <BR>This circle spreads and infected all below and above it. That is what happened. Missing kids just vanished in this &#39;fire&#39;. To see where they went look for a rainbow over a highway that has a view from a classical Greek style window. Spirit shows me blue on blue, all we get are soundless images. Images that show a scene that others may understand. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
